 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, refer to the graph in the given figure.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/6f77418c33fa010f.png\" alt=\"A graph has 7 vertices. The vertices are labeled a, b, c, d, e, f, and g. Edges connect a b, a d, d f, d e, f c, f g, c g, and e b.\">\n",
