   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A student has been asked to use Fleury’s algorithm to construct an Euler trail in the given graph. The student decides to begin the trail at vertex <i>d</i>. Is this a good choice, why or why not?\n",
