   "id": 543696,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A student who is using Fleury’s algorithm to construct an Euler trail has decided to begin with <i>f</i> → <i>d</i> → <i>a</i> → <i>b</i> → …. If the student is off to a good start, help the student by completing the Euler trail. If the student has made an error, explain the error.",
